From 981df2ef1387cdaf89f713b63994f2eaa370deac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 15:44:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(reporting): add 6 new reports with JSON, PDF, and CSV
 endpoints
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add Activity, Member Profile 360, Debt Recovery, Resource Utilization,
Stock Valuation, and Subscription Analytics reports. Each report follows
the existing pattern: Repository (native SQL) → MapStruct Mapper
(interface + decorator) → Service → Controller → Thymeleaf PDF template.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
